[statement]
A package whose condition the preliminary choices complete does not
steer the choice that completes it: `d` 3, the best candidate for `d`,
completes `a`'s condition, and `a` needs `w`, which only `d` 1
provides. apk takes `d` 3 and passes `a` over. Contrast
`a-condition-that-will-hold-steers-an-earlier-choice`, where the choice
steered is another name's.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:d

P:a
V:1
D:w
i:d

P:d
V:3

P:d
V:1
p:w=2

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install d 3
install top 1
